"Capture reads agy's saved Google login once when you press the button, and once each time agy's sign-in changes while automatic capture is on. The copy is kept in this Mac's login keychain. Syrtis uses it only with Google's token service and Cloud Code quota service, and its requests identify as Antigravity." = "捕获会在你点按按钮时读取一次 agy 保存的 Google 登录；自动捕获开启时，agy 的登录每次改变也会读一次。副本保存在这台 Mac 的登录钥匙串。Syrtis 只会把它用在 Google 的令牌服务和 Cloud Code 额度服务，请求会以 Antigravity 的身份发出。";
"Capture accounts agy signs into automatically" = "自动捕获 agy 登录的账户";
"When on, Syrtis copies the sign-in of each account agy signs into to this Mac's login keychain: once when you turn this on, then whenever agy's sign-in changes. Turning it off keeps the copies. An account you remove stays removed until you press Capture." = "开启后，agy 登录的每个账户，Syrtis 都会把它的登录复制到这台 Mac 的登录钥匙串：开启时一次，之后 agy 的登录每次改变时一次。关闭后已有的副本会保留。你移除的账户不会再被自动加回，除非你点按“捕获”。";
"Automatic capture is paused because the login keychain didn't answer. Press Capture to resume." = "登录钥匙串没有响应，自动捕获已暂停。点按“捕获”即可恢复。";
"Automatic capture is unavailable on this Mac." = "这台 Mac 无法使用自动捕获。";
"Turn this on to keep agy's current account merged into one card. With it off, a Capture merges it only until agy next refreshes its sign-in, usually within an hour." = "开启后，agy 当前登录的账号会一直合并为一张卡。关闭时，按「捕获」的合并只维持到 agy 下次更新登录，通常不到一小时。";
"Remove deletes only the copy on this Mac. Google still accepts it until you revoke access in Google Account → third-party access, which also signs Antigravity out of that account." = "移除只会删除这台 Mac 上的副本。在你到“Google 账号 → 第三方访问权限”撤销访问之前，Google 仍会接受它；撤销也会让 Antigravity 退出该账户。";
"Couldn't read agy's login. Check that agy is signed in, and allow access if macOS asks." = "无法读取 agy 的登录。请确认 agy 已登录；macOS 询问时请允许访问。";
"agy's saved login is in a format Syrtis doesn't recognize." = "agy 保存的登录格式 Syrtis 无法识别。";
"agy's saved login doesn't say which Google account it is. Sign agy in again, then try again." = "agy 保存的登录没有标明是哪个 Google 账户。请让 agy 重新登录后再试一次。";
"Couldn't match this login to the installed Antigravity or agy." = "这个登录与已安装的 Antigravity 或 agy 不匹配。";
"Google didn't accept this login. Sign agy in again, then try again." = "Google 不接受这个登录。请让 agy 重新登录后再试一次。";
"Google couldn't be reached right now. Try again later." = "目前无法连接 Google，请稍后再试。";
"Google answered for a different account. Nothing was saved." = "Google 回应的是另一个账户，没有保存任何内容。";
"The login had an unexpected format. Nothing was saved." = "登录的格式不符合预期，没有保存任何内容。";
"Couldn't save to the login keychain." = "无法存入登录钥匙串。";
"Couldn't delete the copy from the login keychain." = "无法从登录钥匙串删除副本。";
"Something went wrong. Try again." = "出现错误，请再试一次。";

/* Cursor usage sync (approved copy: .agent-local/plans/cursor-c3-copy.md) */
"Cursor usage sync" = "Cursor 用量同步";
"Sync Cursor usage from the Cursor app" = "从 Cursor 应用同步用量";
"To show your Cursor usage, Syrtis reads the login of the Cursor app on this Mac and sends it only to Cursor's usage service (cursor.com) to download your usage. Syrtis stores the date, model, token counts, cost and conversation ID of each request on this Mac; the login itself is never saved or logged. Turning this off deletes the downloaded usage." = "要显示 Cursor 用量，Syrtis 会读取这台 Mac 上 Cursor 应用的登录信息，只发送到 Cursor 的用量服务（cursor.com）下载你的用量。Syrtis 会在这台 Mac 上存下每次请求的日期、模型、token 数、费用和对话 ID；登录信息本身不会存储或记录。关闭这个选项会删除已下载的用量。";
"Continue" = "继续";
"Turn Off" = "关闭";
"Last synced %@" = "上次同步：%@";
"Only part of your usage was downloaded. Syrtis will try again." = "只下载到部分用量，Syrtis 会再试一次。";
"Your Cursor login has expired. Open Cursor to refresh it." = "Cursor 的登录已过期，打开 Cursor 就会更新。";
"Sign in to the Cursor app to sync your usage." = "在 Cursor 应用登录后就能同步用量。";
"Can't reach Cursor. Syrtis will try again." = "连不上 Cursor，Syrtis 会再试一次。";
"Cursor usage couldn't be synced. Syrtis will try again later." = "无法同步 Cursor 用量，Syrtis 稍后会再试。";
"Showing Cursor usage from tokscale CLI." = "目前显示的是 tokscale CLI 的 Cursor 用量。";
"Sync Now" = "立即同步";
"Syncing…" = "同步中…";
"You also have Cursor usage from tokscale CLI on this Mac. Use Syrtis's own sync instead? Choose this only if it's the same Cursor account, or that account's usage will no longer be shown." = "这台 Mac 上也有 tokscale CLI 的 Cursor 用量。要改用 Syrtis 自己的同步吗？只有在是同一个 Cursor 账号时才选，否则那个账号的用量就不会再显示。";
"Use Syrtis Sync" = "改用 Syrtis 同步";
"Keep tokscale CLI Data" = "保留 tokscale CLI 的数据";
"Cursor sync is off, but some downloaded usage couldn't be deleted. Restart Syrtis to retry." = "Cursor 同步已关闭，但有部分已下载的用量无法删除。重启 Syrtis 即可再试。";
"Glass tint" = "玻璃深浅";
"Makes the popover's glass less see-through, so its text stays readable over the windows behind it." = "让窗口的玻璃不那么透明，背后有其他窗口时文字也看得清楚。";
"Text hard to read over the windows behind this one? Make the glass less see-through here. You can change it later in Quick settings at the top right." = "背后有其他窗口时，文字不好读吗？可以在这里把玻璃调得不那么透明，之后也能在右上角的快速设置调整。";
"Quick settings" = "快速设置";
